  "instructions": [
    "Soak corn husks in warm water for 30 minutes.",
    "Whisk flour, baking powder, and salt in a bowl.",
    "Add olive oil and 1 cup water to flour mixture and stir until dough forms.",
    "Marinate ground turkey with 1 cup wine, cumin, oregano, chili powder, and salt for 10 minutes.",
    "Spread 2 tbsp of dough onto center of each husk and flatten slightly.",
    "Place 2 tbsp of marinated turkey mixture on top of dough in husk.",
    "Fold husk over filling and seal edges by tucking in excess husk.",
    "Arrange wrapped tamales upright in a steamer basket.",
    "Steam tamales for 60 minutes, keeping water level just below basket.",
    "Remove tamales and let cool 5 minutes before serving."
